{"id":"readme","path":"README.md","title":"✍️ Writeups and Walkthroughs","category":"README.md","source":"https://github.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/blob/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/README.md","html":"<h1 id=\"writeups-and-walkthroughs\">✍️ Writeups and Walkthroughs</h1>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand ✍️ Writeups and Walkthroughs screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(424).png\" alt=\"✍️ Writeups and Walkthroughs screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"try-hack-me-thm\">Try Hack Me (THM)</h2>\n<div><figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand tryhackme.com - © TryHackMe\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/spaces_EhofjMfYbx3gOUSReXD7_uploads_git-blob-d6717517efcd6cf2abc36234ddf89ae069267bc7_image-20230205151515316%20(1).webp\" alt=\"tryhackme.com - © TryHackMe\"></button><figcaption><p>tryhackme.com - © TryHackMe</p></figcaption></figure></div>\n\n<h3 id=\"rooms\">Rooms</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/thm/owasp/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OWASP</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"active-directory\">Active Directory</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--active-directory-basics\">Active Directory Basics</a> (This room will introduce the basic concepts and functionality provided by Active Directory)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--ad-basic-enumeration\">AD: Basic Enumeration</a> (This room covers various Active Directory enumeration techniques, their use cases as well as drawbacks)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--enumerating-active-directory\">Enumerating Active Directory</a> (This room covers various Active Directory enumeration techniques, their use cases as well as drawbacks)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--breaching-active-directory\">Breaching Active Directory</a> (This network covers techniques and tools that can be used to acquire that first set of AD credentials that can then be used to enumerate AD)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--attacking-kerberos\">Attacking Kerberos</a> (Learn how to abuse the Kerberos Ticket Granting Service inside of a Windows Domain Controller)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--attacktive-directory\">Attacktive Directory</a> (99% of Corporate networks run off of AD. But can you exploit a vulnerable Domain Controller?)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--exploiting-active-directory\">Exploiting Active Directory</a> (Learn common AD exploitation techniques that can allow you to reach your goal in an AD environment)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--post-exploitation-basics\">Post-Exploitation Basics </a>(Learn the basics of post-exploitation and maintaining access with mimikatz, bloodhound, powerview and msfvenom)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--lateral-movement-and-pivoting\">Lateral Movement and Pivoting</a> (Learn about common techniques used to move laterally across a Windows network).</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"ctfs\">CTFs</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--rootme\">RootMe</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--simple-ctf\">Simple CTF</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--eternal-blue\">Eternal Blue</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--vulnversity\">Vulnversity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--pickle-rick\">Pickle Rick</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--brooklyn-nine-nine\">Brooklyn Nine Nine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--kenobi\">Kenobi</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--bounty-hacker\">Bounty Hacker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--overpass\">Overpass</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--lazyadmin\">LazyAdmin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--ignite\">Ignite</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--bolt\">Bolt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--agent-sudo\">Agent Sudo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--startup\">Startup</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--wgel\">Wgel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--blog\">Blog</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--coldbox\">ColdBox</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--lian_yu\">Lian_Yu</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--blaster\">Blaster</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--ice\">Ice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/thm--the-sticker-shop\">The Sticker Shop</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"hack-the-box-htb\">Hack The Box (HTB)</h2>\n<div><figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand hackthebox.com - © HACKTHEBOX\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/spaces_EhofjMfYbx3gOUSReXD7_uploads_git-blob-4d6d836c187ed06d910d94a8c98eab79e10bce11_logo-htb2%20(1).webp\" alt=\"hackthebox.com - © HACKTHEBOX\"></button><figcaption><p>hackthebox.com - © HACKTHEBOX</p></figcaption></figure></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/hackthebox--devel\">Devel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/hackthebox--delivery\">Delivery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/hackthebox--active\">Active</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/hackthebox--analytics\">Analytics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/hackthebox--bashed\">Bashed</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/hackthebox--valentine\">Valentine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/hackthebox--sau\">Sau</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/hackthebox--sunday\">Sunday</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/hackthebox--cap\">Cap</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/hackthebox--bizness\">Bizness</a></li>\n<li>Chemistry - OnGoing</li>\n<li>Celestial - OnGoing</li>\n<li>Poison - OnGoing</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"vulnhub\">VulnHub</h2>\n<div><figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand https://www.vulnhub.com/\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(240).png\" alt=\"https://www.vulnhub.com/\" width=\"330\"></button><figcaption><p><a href=\"https://www.vulnhub.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.vulnhub.com/</a></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/vulnhub--brainpain-bof\">Brainpain (BoF)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"vulnix\">Vulnix</h2>\n<div><figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand © VulNyx\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(4)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"© VulNyx\" width=\"375\"></button><figcaption><p>© VulNyx</p></figcaption></figure></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Admin</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"dockerlabs\">DockerLabs</h2>\n<div><figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand https://dockerlabs.es/\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(244).png\" alt=\"https://dockerlabs.es/\" width=\"144\"></button><figcaption><p><a href=\"https://dockerlabs.es/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://dockerlabs.es/</a></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/dockerlabs--trust\">Trust</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/dockerlabs--upload\">Upload</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/dockerlabs--vacaciones\">Vacaciones</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"homemade-labs\">HomeMade Labs 🏠🔬</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/homemade-labs/active-directory/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Active Directory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://app.gitbook.com/o/s2H3MdEB0Qp2IbE58Gxw/s/rRWtuMw6xkkeDjZfkcWC/~/changes/174/homemade-labs/pivoting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Pivoting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://app.gitbook.com/o/s2H3MdEB0Qp2IbE58Gxw/s/rRWtuMw6xkkeDjZfkcWC/~/changes/174/homemade-labs/buffer-overflow-bof\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Buffer Overflow (BoF)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"wapt\">WAPT</h2>\n<h3 id=\"portswigger-web-security-academy\">Portswigger Web Security Academy</h3>\n<div><figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand @PortSwigger Ltd\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(13)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"@PortSwigger Ltd\"></button><figcaption><p>@PortSwigger Ltd</p></figcaption></figure></div>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/portswigger-web-security-academy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PortSwigger - Web Security Academy (My Walkthrough)</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"dvwa\">DVWA </h3>\n<div><figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand https://github.com/digininja/DVWA\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/dvwa-logo-500x500.png\" alt=\"https://github.com/digininja/DVWA\" width=\"250\"></button><figcaption><p><a href=\"https://github.com/digininja/DVWA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/digininja/DVWA</a></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/dvwa--install-and-configure-dvwa\">Install and configure DVWA</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/dvwa--command-injection\">Command Injection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/dvwa--csrf\">Cross Site Request Forgery (CSRF)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/dvwa--file-inclusion\">File Inclusion (LFI + RFI)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/dvwa--sql-injection\">SQL Injection (SQLi)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"owasp-mutillidae-ii\">OWASP - Mutillidae II</h3>\n<div><figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand https://owasp.org/www-project-mutillidae-ii/\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(426).png\" alt=\"https://owasp.org/www-project-mutillidae-ii/\"></button><figcaption><p><a href=\"https://owasp.org/www-project-mutillidae-ii/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://owasp.org/www-project-mutillidae-ii/</a></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/walkthroughs/mutillidae-ii--install-and-configure-owasp-mutillidae-ii\">Install &amp; configure OWASP Mutillidae II</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/mutillidae-ii/sqli/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SQL Injection (SQLi)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/mutillidae-ii/command-injection/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Command Injection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/mutillidae-ii/idor-and-file-inclusion/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">IDOR &amp; File Inclusion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/mutillidae-ii/xss/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cross-Site Scripting (XSS)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"owasp-securebank\">OWASP - SecureBank</h3>\n<div><figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand https://owasp.org/www-project-securebank/\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(427).png\" alt=\"https://owasp.org/www-project-securebank/\"></button><figcaption><p><a href=\"https://owasp.org/www-project-securebank/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://owasp.org/www-project-securebank/</a></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Install and configure OWASP Secure Bank</li>\n</ul>\n","toc":[{"id":"try-hack-me-thm","title":"Try Hack Me (THM)","level":2},{"id":"rooms","title":"Rooms","level":3},{"id":"active-directory","title":"Active Directory","level":4},{"id":"ctfs","title":"CTFs","level":3},{"id":"hack-the-box-htb","title":"Hack The Box (HTB)","level":2},{"id":"vulnhub","title":"VulnHub","level":2},{"id":"vulnix","title":"Vulnix","level":2},{"id":"dockerlabs","title":"DockerLabs","level":2},{"id":"homemade-labs","title":"HomeMade Labs 🏠🔬","level":2},{"id":"wapt","title":"WAPT","level":2},{"id":"portswigger-web-security-academy","title":"Portswigger Web Security Academy","level":3},{"id":"dvwa","title":"DVWA ","level":3},{"id":"owasp-mutillidae-ii","title":"OWASP - Mutillidae II","level":3},{"id":"owasp-securebank","title":"OWASP - SecureBank","level":3}],"excerpt":"✍️ Writeups and Walkthroughs Try Hack Me (THM) tryhackme.com - © TryHackMe Rooms OWASP Active Directory Active Directory Basics (This room will introduce the basic concepts and functionality provided by Active Directory)","searchText":"Try Hack Me (THM) Rooms Active Directory CTFs Hack The Box (HTB) VulnHub Vulnix DockerLabs HomeMade Labs 🏠🔬 WAPT Portswigger Web Security Academy DVWA  OWASP - Mutillidae II OWASP - SecureBank"}